p to Fastest Pace Since 2022","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"05b92b8d7f93","src":"MarketWatch","lang":"en","url":"https://www.marketwatch.com/story/i-inherited-1-4-million-from-my-father-am-i-wrong-to-ask-my-husband-of-25-years-for-a-postnuptial-agreement-b739c51d?mod=mw_rss_topstories","date":"2026-11-13T16:00:00.000Z","title":"I inherited $1.4 million from my father. Am I wrong to ask my husband of 25 years for a postnuptial agreement?","summary":"“He has always said he wants his daughter to inherit a chunk of his estate, and I’ve never objected to that.”","img":"https://images.mktw.net/im-95255307","video":null,"t":"I inherited $1.4 million from my father. Am I wrong to ask my husband of 25 years for a postnuptial agreement?","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"d3d5804747a6","src":"Bloomberg","lang":"en","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-13/patterson-for-now-iran-has-won-the-war-video","date":"2026-11-13T15:54:58.000Z","title":"Patterson: For now, Iran has won the war","summary":"With the Iran war appearing to de-escalate, energy-market pressure may linger. Iran could retain greater influence over the Strait of Hormuz, keeping shipping and insurance costs elevated even as oil flows resume. Charles Schwab Chief Investment Strategist Liz Ann Sonders and Council on Foreign Relations Senior Fellow Rebecca Patterson join Bloomberg Open Interest to talk about their new book “Investment Wisdom,” how higher fuel and refined-product costs may feed inflation, complicate the Fed’s path and weigh on the economy. (Source: Bloomberg)","img":"","video":null,"t":"Patterson: For now, Iran has won the war","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"cb648f581f68","src":"Bloomberg","lang":"en","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-13/finance-experts-reveal-lessons-for-investors-video","date":"2026-11-13T15:53:58.000Z","title":"Finance Experts Reveal Lessons for Investors","summary":"In a world of 24/7 trading, options and investing apps, Charles Schwab Chief Investment Strategist Liz Ann Sonders and Council on Foreign Relations Senior Fellow Rebecca Patterson join Bloomberg Open Interest to talk about their new book, “Investment Wisdom for Our Friends and Loved Ones: Timeless Lessons from Today’s Top Finance Experts.” They share timeless advice: start early, harness the power of compounding, and know the difference between investing and gambling. (Source: Bloomberg)","img":"","video":null,"t":"Finance Experts Reveal Lessons for Investors","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"7e72ed2e9306","src":"Bloomberg","lang":"en","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-13/fed-s-collins-says-additional-policy-firming-appropriate-video","date":"2026-11-13T15:49:32.000Z","title":"Fed's Collins Says Additional Policy Tightening Is Appropriate","summary":"Federal Reserve Bank of Boston President Susan Collins says recent data show inflation is too high and broadening. Speaking with Michael McKee on \"Bloomberg Open Interest,\" Collins adds that because of the increasing inflation risks, more rate tightening is needed. (Source: Bloomberg)","img":"","video":null,"t":"Fed's Collins Says Additional Policy Tightening Is Appropriate","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"7b9f4e36e35b","src":"MarketWatch","lang":"en","url":"https://www.marketwatch.com/story/microsoft-stock-slumps-on-outage-that-includes-the-copilot-tool-it-has-been-heavily-promoting-4007dc4f?mod=mw_rss_topstories","date":"2026-11-13T15:44:00.000Z","title":"Microsoft Outlook outage stretches into a second day, causing widespread disruption","summary":"The outage could result in a $100 million to $400 million negative impact to Microsoft if the company offers credits and other compensation to customers, one analyst said.","img":"https://images.mktw.net/im-38565839","video":null,"t":"Microsoft Outlook outage stretches into a second day, causing widespread disruption","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"d25249c5dde1","src":"Financial Times","lang":"en","url":"https://www.ft.com/content/20b68fe2-9d60-4c0c-b714-1f3e03015823?syn-25a6b1a6=1","date":"2026-11-13T15:42:48.000Z","title":"Global oil markets swing to surplus as Gulf shipments rebound","summary":"IEA analysts warn it will take months to rebuild stockpiles depleted by US-Iran war","img":"https://images.ft.com/v3/image/raw/https%3A%2F%2Fd1e00ek4ebabms.cloudfront.net%2Fproduction%2Fad415f5f-16ba-41d3-beee-e18bc6aa0445.jpg?source=next-home-page&dpr=2&width=580&fit=scale-down","video":null,"t":"Global oil markets swing to surplus as Gulf shipments rebound","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"e295d5c69f10","src":"Bloomberg","lang":"en","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-13/anthropic-ipo-share-orders-from-china-are-said-to-be-rebuffed","date":"2026-11-13T15:37:27.000Z","title":"Anthropic IPO Share Orders From China Are Said to Be Rebuffed","summary":"Institutional investors based in mainland China and Hong Kong have been excluded from placing orders in Anthropic PBC’s initial public offering, according to people familiar with the matter, highlighting the sensitivities around an industry both Washington and Beijing consider strategic.","img":"","video":null,"t":"Anthropic IPO Share Orders From China Are Said to Be Rebuffed","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"9ca93a1531d9","src":"MarketWatch","lang":"en","url":"https://www.marketwatch.com/story/im-17-and-will-be-a-first-generation-college-student-is-law-school-worth-being-200-000-in-debt-df9b23c3?mod=mw_rss_topstories","date":"2026-11-13T15:37:00.000Z","title":"I’m 17 and will be a first-generation college student. Is law school worth being $200,000 in debt?","summary":"“I‘’m considering a pre-law track … I’m just a bit hesitant because of how expensive law school is.”","img":"https://images.mktw.net/im-33216329","video":null,"t":"I’m 17 and will be a first-generation college student. Is law school worth being $200,000 in debt?","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"12e7efc71fc9","src":"Financial Times","lang":"en","url":"https://www.ft.com/content/7bebace2-dc87-410a-ae29-ffd9f3176def?syn-25a6b1a6=1","date":"2026-11-13T15:36:00.000Z","title":"US Treasuries set for worst week since Trump’s ‘liberation day’","summary":"Higher than expected inflation and hawkish remarks by Fed officials have stung investors who bet a global bond rout was over","img":"https://images.ft.com/v3/image/raw/https%3A%2F%2Fd1e00ek4ebabms.cloudfront.net%2Fproduction%2F4fec4b22-08a3-4436-823e-116384aaa77f.jpg?source=next-home-page&dpr=2&width=580&fit=scale-down","video":null,"t":"US Treasuries set for worst week since Trump’s ‘liberation day’","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"7f6983147c3f","src":"Bloomberg","lang":"en","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-13/wall-street-regulator-finra-moves-to-give-industry-bigger-role","date":"2026-11-13T15:33:25.000Z","title":"Wall Street Regulator Finra Moves to Give Industry Bigger Role","summary":"The Financial Industry Regulatory Authority wants to give the industry it helps regulate a bigger role in its oversight, proposing the first major shakeup in decades to the Wall Street watchdog’s governing board.","img":"","video":null,"t":"Wall Street Regulator Finra Moves to Give Industry Bigger Role","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"3c4355507bc7","src":"MarketWatch","lang":"en","url":"https://www.marketwatch.com/story/he-calls-my-plans-a-fantasy-my-husband-says-we-cant-afford-our-200-000-a-year-dream-retirement-i-think-hes-cheap-45bc5b4e?mod=mw_rss_topstories","date":"2026-11-13T15:30:00.000Z","title":"‘He calls my plans a fantasy’: My husband says we can’t afford a $200,000-a-year retirement. Is he being cheap?","summary":"“We have $2 million saved in our retirement accounts and a house worth $1.3 million.”","img":"https://images.mktw.net/im-61252759","video":null,"t":"‘He calls my plans a fantasy’: My husband says we can’t afford a $200,000-a-year retirement. Is he being cheap?","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"023cc410c666","src":"Financial Times","lang":"en","url":"https://www.ft.com/content/025b2769-bca8-4a74-b9f5-5d7ad7da32c7?syn-25a6b1a6=1","date":"2026-11-13T15:29:45.000Z","title":"Microsoft races to restore services after global outage","summary":"German government says it ‘anticipates a very big impact’ on economy","img":"https://images.ft.com/v3/image/raw/https%3A%2F%2Fd1e00ek4ebabms.cloudfront.net%2Fproduction%2F2e6ddf7d-9eb1-496e-ba27-4e69b49a1457.jpg?source=next-home-page&dpr=2&width=580&fit=scale-down","video":null,"t":"Microsoft races to restore services after global outage","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"0c0e6cd9ed39","src":"Bloomberg","lang":"en","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-13/senegal-picks-deloitte-to-audit-debt-as-it-seeks-imf-loan-pact","date":"2026-11-13T15:20:47.000Z","title":"Senegal Picks Deloitte to Audit Debt as It Seeks IMF Loan Pact","summary":"Senegal selected Deloitte to audit its public debt, according to people familiar with the matter, taking a step toward meeting conditions for a proposed $2.2 billion International Monetary Fund program.","img":"","video":null,"t":"Senegal Picks Deloitte to Audit Debt as It Seeks IMF Loan Pact","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"5e8670301900","src":"Bloomberg","lang":"en","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-13/opinion-new-corporate-speak-is-shaped-by-ai-video","date":"2026-11-13T15:20:47.000Z","title":"New Corporate Speak Is Shaped By AI","summary":"Corporate managements are using new euphemisms for job cuts or hiring freezes far more in the age of AI, as technology-enabled headcount reductions increasingly draw public ire and pushback from politicians, bloomberg Opinion columnist Jonathan Levin says. As a result, company leaders are leaning on vague talking points about “efficiency,” “automation” and, yes, “delayering.” (Source: Bloomberg)","img":"","video":null,"t":"New Corporate Speak Is Shaped By AI","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"f568d27d041a","src":"Bloomberg","lang":"en","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-13/logan-seeks-clearer-fed-separation-of-market-operations-video","date":"2026-11-13T15:19:45.000Z","title":"Fed’s Logan Seeks Clearer Separation of Market Operations","summary":"Federal Reserve Bank of Dallas President Lorie Logan called for the US central bank to separate assets purchased for market-functioning purposes from the ones it holds for monetary-policy operations. “One way to keep market functioning purchases from providing undesired stimulus would be for the FOMC to hold the purchased securities in a separate account and commit to sell them as soon as possible,” Logan said Friday at a bank funding conference co-hosted by the Dallas Fed. (Source: Bloomberg)","img":"","video":null,"t":"Fed’s Logan Seeks Clearer Separation of Market Operations","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"e35ff791eb7a","src":"MarketWatch","lang":"en","url":"https://www.marketwatch.com/story/she-has-a-history-of-financial-mismanagement-my-brother-cut-my-sister-out-of-his-will-im-getting-everything-do-i-tell-her-3e537851?mod=mw_rss_topstories","date":"2026-11-13T15:15:00.000Z","title":"‘She has a history of financial mismanagement’: My brother cut our sister out of his will. I’ll get everything. Do I tell her?","summary":"“I’m torn between respecting my brother’s wishes and being fair to my sister.”","img":"https://images.mktw.net/im-10553254","video":null,"t":"‘She has a history of financial mismanagement’: My brother cut our sister out of his will. I’ll get everything. Do I tell her?","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"4ad9d5294d12","src":"MarketWatch","lang":"en","url":"https://www.marketwatch.com/story/am-i-overpaying-for-health-insurance-how-to-answer-the-key-question-this-open-enrollment-season-2d00ed55?mod=mw_rss_topstories","date":"2026-11-13T15:11:00.000Z","title":"Am I overpaying for health insurance? How to answer the key question this open-enrollment season.","summary":"More people want to understand the fine print on plans this year, financial planners say.","img":"https://images.mktw.net/im-09785707","video":null,"t":"Am I overpaying for health insurance? How to answer the key question this open-enrollment season.","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"894067f1c8c2","src":"MarketWatch","lang":"en","url":"https://www.marketwatch.com/story/home-sales-plummet-to-lowest-level-since-the-great-recession-as-buyers-flee-the-market-624e6270?mod=mw_rss_topstories","date":"2026-11-13T15:08:00.000Z","title":"Home sales plummet to lowest level since ‘Great Recession’ as prices hit all-time high","summary":"Home sales fell in October to a 16-year low as buyers bolted from the housing market in the face of 7% mortgage rates.","img":"https://images.mktw.net/im-33452454","video":null,"t":"Home sales plummet to lowest level since ‘Great Recession’ as prices hit all-time high","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"32bfa3ea805e","src":"Bloomberg","lang":"en","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-13/ukraine-hits-ninth-russian-oil-refinery-since-start-of-november","date":"2026-11-13T15:04:05.000Z","title":"Ukraine Hits Ninth Russian Oil Refinery Since Start of November","summary":"Ukraine continued its campaign of near daily strikes on Russian oil assets, hitting a major refinery in the Volga region on Friday after the latest round of US-mediated peace talks between the two nations ended earlier this week.","img":"","video":null,"t":"Ukraine Hits Ninth Russian Oil Refinery Since Start of November","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"29b51d535316","src":"MarketWatch","lang":"en","url":"https://www.marketwatch.com/story/the-2027-401-k-limits-are-here-see-how-much-more-you-can-save-next-year-d525768c?mod=mw_rss_topstories","date":"2026-11-13T15:03:00.000Z","title":"The 2027 401(k) limits are here. See how much more you can save next year.","summary":"Defined-contribution plans are getting a bump. IRA savers are not.","img":"https://images.mktw.net/im-77905161","video":null,"t":"The 2027 401(k) limits are here. See how much more you can save next year.","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"bfce14cfb339","src":"Bloomberg","lang":"en","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-13/russian-diesel-exports-drop-as-ukraine-renews-refinery-attacks","date":"2026-11-13T14:59:35.000Z","title":"Russian Diesel Exports Drop as Ukraine Renews Refinery Attacks","summary":"Russian diesel exports slumped at the start of November as renewed Ukrainian attacks on refineries threatened to curb fuel output, even as stronger dirty-fuel shipments lifted the country’s overall oil-product flows.","img":"","video":null,"t":"Russian Diesel Exports Drop as Ukraine Renews Refinery Attacks","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"f5122b0f8993","src":"Bloomberg","lang":"en","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-13/mexico-rate-cut-fuels-speculation-officials-want-a-weaker-peso","date":"2026-11-13T14:53:13.000Z","title":"Mexico Rate Cut Fuels Speculation Officials Want a Weaker Peso","summary":"Traders are increasingly speculating Mexico’s central bank is pushing to weaken the currency whose strength threatened to weigh on exports and tourism.","img":"","video":null,"t":"Mexico Rate Cut Fuels Speculation Officials Want a Weaker Peso","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"e43431c1a996","src":"Bloomberg","lang":"en","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-13/senegal-bonds-plunge-as-budget-row-puts-imf-program-at-risk","date":"2026-11-13T14:31:14.000Z","title":"Senegal Bonds Plunge as Budget Row Puts IMF Program at Risk","summary":"Senegal’s dollar bonds fell this week as a budget standoff threatens to delay the government’s efforts to secure a $2.2 billion International Monetary Fund program.","img":"","video":null,"t":"Senegal Bonds Plunge as Budget Row Puts IMF Program at Risk","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"e687ead4fd42","src":"Bloomberg","lang":"en","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-13/draftkings-predictions-bet-has-bulls-reeling-from-sticker-shock","date":"2026-11-13T14:30:10.000Z","title":"DraftKings’ Predictions Bet Has Bulls Reeling From Sticker Shock","summary":"DraftKings Inc.’s plans to pour money into prediction markets is worrying Wall Street analysts who view the lack of regulatory clarity as a key risk, spurring a flood of downgrades for the stock.","img":"","video":null,"t":"DraftKings’ Predictions Bet Has Bulls Reeling From Sticker Shock","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"5d2ad16517e0","src":"Bloomberg","lang":"en","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-13/anthropic-ipo-to-cap-year-of-record-breaking-equity-megadeals","date":"2026-11-13T14:19:49.000Z","title":"Anthropic IPO to Cap Year of Record-Breaking Equity Megadeals","summary":"Anthropic PBC is poised to add to a blockbuster year of transactions that are orders of magnitude larger than those seen in the past decade, with the biggest initial public offering of all time joining a half dozen other jumbo equity deals.","img":"","video":null,"t":"Anthropic IPO to Cap Year of Record-Breaking Equity Megadeals","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"da6ba4825f9b","src":"Коммерсантъ · Экономика","lang":"ru","url":"https://www.kommersant.ru/doc/9109013","date":"2026-11-13T14:14:58.000Z","title":"Промышленников склоняют к постоянству // Эксперимент по обелению рынка предоставления персонала расширен","summary":"Производственные предприятия смогут добровольно присоединиться к запущенному с 1 сентября 2026 года эксперименту Федеральной налоговой службы по обелению отрасли предоставления персонала. В ведомстве рассчитывают, что этот эксперимент позволит сократить масштабы экономии на налогах при предоставлении персонала компаниям частными агентствами занятости. Это, в свою очередь, сделает привлечение временных исполнителей работ менее привлекательной альтернативой «обычному» найму в штат.","img":"https://im2.kommersant.ru/Issues.photo2/DAILY/2026/211/KNN_006639_00210_1_t219_165745.jpg","video":null,"t":"Промышленников склоняют к постоянству // Эксперимент по обелению рынка предоставления персонала расширен","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"1411377b7314","src":"Financial Times","lang":"en","ur